password eye; renderer/ac_content_renderer_client.cc), out of the page's reach. Linux has its own
ISOLATED_WORLD_ID_ARDIA_PAGE (chromium-linux-page-agent.patch).

--- a/chrome/common/chrome_isolated_world_ids.h
